|| śivābhyāṃ namaḥ ||

|| {prodgīte vivāhavidhiḥ} ||


śrīkaṇṭharudramīśānaṃ pañcakṛtvaparāyaṇam |
papraccha parayā bhaktyā viṣṇuratyantaharṣitaḥ || 1 ||

bhagavan sarvalokeśa lokarakṣādhuraṃdhara |
satīviyogaje kāle lokānāṃ varddhirāditaḥ || 2 ||

nābhavatkila viśvātman tadā lokāḥ kathaṃ sthitāḥ |
utpattiḥ kathameteṣāmavicchinnā vabhūva ca || 3 ||

tadrahasyanna jānāmi vada me karuṇānidhe |
iti pṛṣṭo mahādevo viṣṇunā prabhaviṣṇunā || 4 ||

uvāca pārvatīnāthastaṃ vṛttamavatārayat |
dakṣaṃ nirīśvaraṃ yāgaṃ prāvartata purā kila || 5 ||

tattvayā viditaṃ sarvamathāpi tvadvikṣayā |
vakṣyāmi sarvametat kathāṃ vistarataśśṛṇu || 6 ||

satī yadā svakaṃ dehaṃ pramumoca samādhinā |
tadā nirutsavo lokaḥ prajāvṛddhivivarjitaḥ || 7 ||

anāvṛṣṭi paripluṣṭaḥ kṣayamāpa dine dine |
tadā brahmādayo devāssametya mama sannidhau || 8 ||

praṇipatya pariploṣaṃ jagataste vyajijñipat |
tadā lokahitārthāya saṃbodhayadacyuta || 9 ||

<p. 2>

indrādīnāṃ dikpatīnāṃ santatiḥ prabhaviṣyati |
sā tatrāpyagajā gaurī bhaviṣyati dharāpate || 10 ||

tāṅkanyāṃ vāmadevāya śivāya dadatassvayam |
tadā prabhṛti loko'yaṃ varddhate pūrvavatkila || 11 ||

ityājñaptāśca te devāstayorvaivāhikīṅkriyām |
akurvan tatpravakṣyāmi śṛṇuṣvādarapūrvakam || 12 ||

tadā caturmukho brahmā vasiṣṭhādyā munīśvarāḥ |
prādurāsītsapatnīkāḥ maheśapriyakāmyayā || 13 ||

lokasaṅgrahaṇārthāya laukikīṃ vṛttimāśritāḥ |
saptarṣīn preṣayāmāsuḥ kanyāniścaya hetave || 14 ||

sapatnīkāssamājagmurnagendra gṛhamuttamam |
sanārikelakadalīpūgīphala samanvitam || 15 ||

vastrayugmaṃ samādāya kañcukaṃ kanakāñcitam |
nagendrāṅke sanniṣaṇṇāṃ vavrire kanyakāṃ mudā || 16 ||

pūrṇacandrābhavadanāṃ nīlakuñcitamūrdhajām |
susmitāpāṅga saṃrūdamakaradhvaja śālinīm || 17 ||

uduttareti mantreṇa brahmaghoṣapurassaram |
arūṃdhatī tadā kanyāṃ gandhapuṣpopahārakaiḥ || 18 ||

alañcakāra suprītāmumāṃ tāṃ samalaṅkṛtām |
tadā himādrimenākīmukhamaikṣata vismitaḥ || 19 ||

<p. 3>

sā'numene tadā gīrīṃ pradātuṃ śambhurūpiṇe |
maheśāya tadā devī sahitastu mahīpatiḥ || 20 ||

dāsyāmīti tadā vācamuvāca sa nagādhipaḥ |
athoṣadhīnāmadhipe vṛddhiṃ prāpte supuṣkale || 21 ||

jāmitre ca tithau maitre muhūrteśśaśalāñcchane |
uttarāphalgunīyukte muhūrtaṃ samayojayan || 22 ||

evaṃ śāstroktamārgeṇaṃ vivāhaṅkārayeti ca |
brahmāṇaṃ preṣayāmāsa sa pinākī maheśvaraḥ || 23 ||

tathaiva kārayāmāsa brahmā lokapitāmahaḥ |
anenaiva vidhānena pārvatīñca dadau giriḥ || 24 ||

etena kāraṇe naiva devānāṃ santatirbabhau |
indrasyāpi jayanto'bhūnnalakūvara eva ca || 25 ||

kuberasya sa devānāṃ santatiścābhavatkila |
anaṅgo'pi tadā sāṅgaḥ ratiprītikaraḥ prabhuḥ || 26 ||

[iti prodgīte vivāhavidhirnāma pañcaviṃśati paṭalaḥ] || 25 ||


atha viṣṇurmahādevaṃ papraccha parayā mudā |
pralayo mānuṣe loke prajānāśaḥ pade pade || 1 ||

dāridryaṃ prāṇividveṣaḥ kathannasyāt prabho vada |
athovāca mahādevaḥ gaurīvaivāhikaṃ vidhim || 2 ||

ālaye ca pratiṣṭhāyāmutsavādau viśeṣataḥ |
kartavyaṃ vidhipūrvantu vedāgamavidhānataḥ || 3 ||

tadvakṣye śṛṇu viṣṇo tvaṃ saṅgraheṇa janārdana |
etadā yuṣyamārogyaṃ putrapautravivarddhanam || 4 ||

dhānyaṃ yaśaskarañcaivāpamṛtyu nivārakam |
saumaṅglyaṃ sadā saukhyaṃ vardhanañca viśeṣataḥ || 5 ||

phālgune caitravaiśākhe tiṣye vāpi viśeṣataḥ |
ṛkṣe cottaraphalgunyāṃ maitre'nyacchubha(-)ṛkṣake || 6 ||

sumuhūrte (* * * * * * * *) bhṛgordine |
vaivāhikavidhiṃ kuryāt sādhakassarvatantravit || 7 ||

śivadvija (* * * * * * * *) bhiṣecanaḥ |
śivaśāstravicārajñaḥ śivāgamaviśāradaḥ || 8 ||

dukūlavasano (* * * * * *) ttarīyakaḥ |
bhasmarudrākṣamālābhiralaṅkṛta kalevaraḥ || 9 ||

hemayajñopa (* * * * * * * *) ṇḍitaḥ |
śuklacandanaliptāṅgaśśuklamālairalaṅkṛtaḥ || 10 ||

evaṃ lakṣaṇayu (* * * * * * *) vratam |
prārthayeddevadevasya kalyāṇaṃ kuru bho gurau || 11 ||

<p. 5>

iti prārthya namaskṛtya (* * * * * * * *) |
iti saṃprārthya śārginyajamānena deśikaḥ || 12 ||

āsthānamaṇṭape ramye śatastambha samanvite |
(* * * * * * * *) raṅgavalyādiśobhite || 13 ||

kadalīstambhakharjūrī vitānaddhvajatoraṇaiḥ |
patā (* * * * * * * *) dhūpaiśca śobhite || 14 ||

paṇavairmaddalaiścaiva nānāvāditranisvane |
(* * * * * *) ktaiśca gaurīkalyāṇa vaibhavaiḥ || 15 ||

bhūṣite maṇṭape śubhre brāhma (* * * * * *) |
(* * * *) vidhijñaiśca vedavedāṅganiṣṭhitaiḥ || 16 ||

rājabhissacivaiścaiva bhaṭairyodhai (* * * * *) |
(* * * * *) nairanyairnaranārī sahasrakaiḥ || 17 ||

śobhite sadane madhye (* *) maṇṭapamādarāt |
tanmadhye padmavedīñca tatpūrve padmakuṇḍakam || 18 ||

svastikaṃ maṇḍalaṃ kuryāt āgamoktavidhānataḥ |
paścime bhadrapīṭhe ca svastikākhye maheśvaram || 19 ||

saṃsthāpya dakṣiṇe bhāge gaurīṃ kalyāṇarūpiṇīm |
devyā dakṣiṇadigbhāge himavantaṃ samenakam || 20 ||

viṣṇuṃ śrībhūmisahitaṃ kalaśeṣu samarcayet |
agnerdakṣiṇadigbhāge vāgdevīñcaturānanam || 21 ||

<p. 6>

sanakādīṃśca yogīndrān brahmaṇaḥ purato yajet |
devasya vāmabhāge tu yajeddurgādi yoginīm || 22 ||

devasyeśānadigbhāge rūdrān pramathanāyakān |
saptarṣīṃśca pattnīṃśca sarvadevarṣimaṇḍalam || 23 ||

yajettu purato bhāge śacīmindraṃ vasūṃstathā |
paścime menakādīṃśca yajedapsarasāṃ gaṇān || 24 ||

viṣṇvādi devabṛndāṃśca kalaśeṣu yathākramam |
miśratantravidhānena pratimāsu prapūjayet || 25 ||

ācāryo mūrtipaissārdhaṃ devadevasya sannidhau |
anujñāṃ vidhivatkuryāt brāhmaṇānāṃ samājage || 26 ||

deva deva jagannātha jagadānandakāraṇa |
kalyāṇārthaṃ pravarto'haṃ lokasaṅgrahaṇāya ca || 27 ||

lokānāmiṣṭakāmyārthaṃ tavājñāṃ kuru me prabho |
tato devyālayaṃ gatvā prārthayediṣṭasiddhaye || 28 ||

ambike devi kalyāṇi kāruṇyākaracandrike |
jagadārtivināśāya śambhupatnī bhaviṣyasi || 29 ||

ityuktvā tāṃ mahādevīṃ praṇipatya gurūttamaḥ |
vaivāhya mūrtiṃ saṃprāpya prārthayediṣṭasiddhaye || 30 ||

somāskandādideveṣu pañcaviṃśatikeṣu ca |
ye ye śaktiyutā devāsteṣvekasya vidhānataḥ || 31 ||

<p. 7>

varṣe varṣe prakurvīta vaivāhikamanuttamam |
udvāhabhāvanārthāya devadevau prapūjayet || 32 ||

śaktivighneśamabhyarcya grahaprītipurassaram |
saṅkalpañca tataḥ kuryān mṛtsaṅgrahaṇamaṅkuram || 33 ||

kṛtvā pratisaraṃ baddhā devyā devasya caiva hi |
paredyuḥ prātarutthāya saṃbhārān saṃbhriyāttataḥ || 34 ||

tato devyālayaṃ gatvā vāṅniścayavidhiñcaret |
tato brahmādayo devā vasiṣṭhādyā munīśvarāḥ || 35 ||

prādurāsan sa patnīkāḥ maheśapriyakāmyayā |
lokasaṅgrahaṇārthāya laukikīṃ vṛttimāśritāḥ || 36 ||

satānabhyarcya devādīn gandhapuṣpākṣatādibhiḥ |
sanālikerakadalī pūgīphalasamanvitam || 37 ||

vastrayugmaṃ samādāya kañcukaṃ kanakāñcitam |
uduttareti mantreṇa brahmaghoṣapurassaram || 38 ||

samprārthya devīmabhyarcya vastrapuṣpopahārakaiḥ |
udvāhārthaṃ parāśaktiṃ prapūjyā'tha viśeṣataḥ || 39 ||

uktadravyayutaistoyaiḥ pādyamācamanārghyakam |
paryūṣitārcanaṃ kṛtvā snānaśālāpraveśanam || 40 ||

sihmāsane tu saṃsthāpya nṛttagītapurassaram |
sugandhatailābhyaṅgaṃ snānīyodvartanaṃ tathā || 41 ||

<p. 8>

uṣṇodakasnāpanañca sarvadravyābhiṣecanam |
tataḥ kuryādviśeṣeṇa dhautavastrapramārjanam || 42 ||

dukūlaparidhānañca uttarīyasamanvitam |
candanāgarukastūrī kuṅkumādi vilepanam || 43 ||

keśānāmagaro dhūpaṃ yathā vidhi vidhāya ca |
mallikāmālatī jāti campakādyarpaṇaṃ tathā || 44 ||

navaratnakirīṭañca candrarekhāvataṃsakam |
sīmantadeśe sindūraṃ lalāṭe tilakaṃ tathā || 45 ||

kālāñjanamadho kṛtvā pālīyugalameva ca |
maṇikuṇḍalayugmañca nāsābharaṇamapyatha || 46 ||

adhare yāvakañcaiva tataḥ prathamabhūṣaṇam |
cintākaṃ patakañcaiva mahāpatakameva ca || 47 ||

muktāvalīmeka muktāvalīmapi vinirdiśet |
vaikakṣyahāraṃ keyūracatuṣṭayamathāpi vā || 48 ||

valayānāmāvalīśca ūrmikāvalimeva ca |
kāñcīdāma samāropya kaṭisūtramathopari || 49 ||

saubhāgyābharaṇañcaiva sarvaratnavibhūṣitam |
pādayoḥ kaṭakañcaiva ratnanūpurameva ca || 50 ||

pādāṅgulīyakañcaiva samāropya viśeṣataḥ |
āyudhāni kare kṛtvā tattatkālaviśeṣataḥ || 51 ||

<p. 9>

pādukārohaṇaṃ kāryaṃ mahāmaṅgalasaṃyutam |
dhūpadīpaṃ tathā kṛtvā pañcānnādīnnivedayet || 52 ||

ṣoḍaśairūpacāraiśca tāmbūlaṃ mantrapuṣpakam |
tattanmantraiśca sampūjya gaurīṃ kalyāṇa rūpiṇīm || 53 ||

athāropya gaje devīṃ sihme vā samalaṅkṛtām |
ādiśaktisaparyārthaṃ nadītīre prapādiṣu || 54 ||

samāveśya tadā devīṃ nānāvāditra nisvanaiḥ |
kumbhaṃ saṃsthāpya vidhivat pūjayitvopacārakaiḥ || 55 ||

kastūrikuṅkumālepa kajjalādibhirādarāt |
kaborākṣidarpaṇādi sambhārairatiśobhanaiḥ || 56 ||

bījamudgāni naivedya pūrṇakarma samācaret |
stuvīta brāhmaṇaissārdhaṃ prāṅmukhairbrahmavādibhiḥ || 57 ||

ādimadhyāntarahitāṃ ambāmamitavigrahām |
praṇamāmi mahādevīṃ mahāttripura bhairavīm || 58 ||

madiṣṭadevate devi mama prītivivardhanam |
bhartāraṃ varaye devi śivamatyantasundaram || 59 ||

ghaṭayasva jaganmātardīrghamāṅgalya vṛddhaye |
iti prārthya parāṃ devīṃ pūjayitvā tataḥ param || 60 ||

ādiśaktimameyāṃ tāṃ dhyātvā niścalatāṃ yayau |
tatraiva jātakarmādi kuryāddevyāḥ prayatnataḥ || 61 ||

<p. 10>

ācāryassarva sambhārān vādyaghoṣapurassaram |
gṛhītvā devadevasya kalyāṇādiṣu mūrtiṣu || 62 ||

yasya kasyāpi purataḥ gatvā prārthya pura sthitaḥ |
deva deva jagannātha jagadārtihara prabho || 63 ||

anujñāṃ dehi me svāmin kalyāṇārthantu vā'dhunā |
iti samprārthya deveśaṃ dhūpadīpau nivedya ca || 64 ||

abhiṣekaṃ tataḥ kṛtvā snānīyaissnapanodakaiḥ |
rudrādhyāyamanuṃ japtvā sarvavādyapurassaram || 65 ||

(* * * * * * * *) niyojyā bharaṇāni ca |
makuṭāṅgadakeyūrahāranūpurakaṅkaṇīm |
kaṭisūtraṃ yajñasūtra (* * * * * *) baliḥ || 66 ||

evamādibhiranyaiśca pādukādibhireva ca |
jājīcampaka punnāga kahlārakama (* * * *) || 67 ||

(* * * * *) dyaiśca pūjayitvā maheśvaram |
kārayeddevadevasya śivasya paramātmanaḥ || 68 ||

vratādikamatho (* * * * * * *) maṅgalam |
sarvopacāraissaṃpūjya vṛṣamārohayecchivam || 69 ||

sarvavādyasamāyuktaṃ nānābi (* * * * * *) |
(* * * * * *) to gacchet svastimaṅgalapūrvakam || 70 ||

<p. 11>

tatra gatvā tayā sārddhaṃ pādyārghyācamanādibhiḥ |
upacārya tataḥ (* * * * *) caturvidham || 71 ||

nivedaddhūpadīpaiścchatraiścāmara vījanaiḥ |
upacārya yathā śāstraṃ nīrājanamatha (* *) || 72 ||

(* * * *) mya tau devau vṛṣasihmāsanasthitau |
utthāpya maṇṭapāgre tu sthāpayet pūrvapaścimam || 73 ||

mālāvinimaya (* * * * * *) ṇameva ca |
vādyaiḥ pradakṣiṇī kṛtya dāsīdīpasamanvitaiḥ || 74 ||

kalyāṇamaṇṭape ramye svastimaṇṭapa (* * *) |
samāveśya pūrvābhimukhamāsthitau || 75 ||

tato yakṣabaliṅkuryāt ācāryassādhakaissaha |
puṇyā (* * * * * * * * *) kadalīphalam || 76 ||

raktapuṣpasamopetaṃ baliṃ dadyādvicakṣaṇaḥ |
kṛtvā vivāhasaṅkalpaṃ varapreṣaṇa (* * *) || 77 ||

(* *) ke maṇḍale samyagādi kartāramarcayet |
haribrahmādi devanāmarcanaṅkalaśeṣu ca || 78 ||

sampūjya vidhiva (* * * * * * *) dhinā yajet |
prasugmanteti mantreṇa varapreṣaṇamācaret || 79 ||

āpa (* * * *) ti mantreṇa pā (* * * * *) |
yanmadhuno madhavyeti madhuparkaṃ samarcayet || 80 ||

<p. 12>

kanyakādāna saṅkalpaṃ kṛtvā tatra vidhānataḥ |
gṛhītvā (* * * * * * *) māpya śivasya hi || 81 ||

gṛbhṇāmīti ca mantreṇa pāṇigrahaṇamācaret |
atha pracchannavastreṇa prā (* * * * * * *) || 82 ||

(* * *) ṣṭakamārabhya vācayetsasvaraṃ kramāt |
vastrayugmaṃ tadādāya tasyopari yathā vidhi || 83 ||

maṃ (* * * * * * * *) prānugrahamācaret |
baddhvā māṅgalyasūtrañca gaurībījena deśikaḥ || 84 ||

pādukāṃ pārvatīṃ (* * * * * * *) kottamaḥ |
ekamiṣeti mantreṇa saptavāraṃ vrajetkramāt || 85 ||

śivāgniṃ sthāpayitvā tu paristaraṇapūrvakam |
(* * *) prokṣaṇīñcaiva lājānājyañca sādhayet || 86 ||

mūlenāṣṭottaraṃ hutvā somāyeti ca mantrataḥ |
lājahoma (* * * *) pradakṣiṇapurassaram || 87 ||

triḥ kṛtvā ca samiddhe'gnau śeṣā ājyāhutīrhunet |
cittañcetyādi mantraiśca jayāda (* * * * *) || 88 ||

nālikerakapitthādi phalavargaissamanvitām |
drākṣā kharjūranāraṅga khaṇḍaśarkarayānvitām || 89 ||

ikṣukhaṇḍa (* * * * * * * *) paśobhitām |
pūrṇāhutimatho hutvā sapteti ca mantrataḥ || 90 ||

<p. 13>

upasthānamatho kṛtvā praṇame (* * * * *) |
* * * prāṅmukho bhūtvā prārthayedbrāhmaṇānatha || 91 ||

ārdrākṣatān samāropya svastivācana |
(* * * * *) rañcaiva pūjayedvidhipūrvakam || 92 ||

dhūpadīpādinaivedyatāmbulādyupacārakaiḥ |
pūrva (* * * * * *) nivedyāpūpamodakān || 93 ||

tāmbūlādīn tato datvā gandhapuṣpādi (* * *) |
(* * * * * * * *) bhakṣya bhojyaphalādikaiḥ || 94 ||

vīthī pradakṣiṇaṃ kuryāt sarvānugraha ve (* *) |
(* * * * * * * *) sa vidhodvāhameva ca || 95 ||

sa dīrghāyuravāpnoti putrān pautrāṃśca vindati |
(* * * * * * * * * * * *) ha modate || 96 ||

[iti prodgīte vivāhavidhirnāma ṣaḍviṃśati paṭalaḥ] || 26 ||

